# drill: interrupted_publisher_republishes_new_content::loopback
# expect: the interrupted publisher: no announcement change
#
# Removes the relay's withdrawal of a publisher it lost. Each announced route
# holds an origin handle whose drop retracts it; wrapping that in `ManuallyDrop`
# means a route outlives the session that announced it, so a crashed publisher's
# name stays announced with nothing behind it. Explicit withdrawals still consume
# the handle, so only the implicit retraction on session loss is removed.
